  "intent": "REALISTA condensadora — air-cooled condensing unit; three r160 standalone HTML; 1u=1m; realista = parametric geometry, NOT PBR-on-voxel. TRANSLATES the approved VOXEL as the dimensional source of truth (voxel is truth; realista preserves its cotas, never re-invents). Reuses 5 library sub-assembly parts (finned-coil, fan-assembly, electrical-box, fastener-kit, refrig-cluster-adapted). Every added part is a SUB-PART INSIDE a preserved massing AABB, so GR3 drift stays ~0. Real dims: cabinet 2.40x1.50x1.20 m on a skid, condenser coil on both long faces, 2x top-discharge axial fan Ø0.86 m, scroll compressor + liquid receiver + suction/discharge service valves in the machine end, controls box.",
